[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3841.829, "timestamp": "01:04:01", "text": "それはかなり低いですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3856.309, "timestamp": "01:04:16", "text": "私のチャットはメインIDを知っているんですよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3857.75, "timestamp": "01:04:17", "text": "つまり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3859.109, "timestamp": "01:04:19", "text": "メインのIDから来るように言われているんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3862.069, "timestamp": "01:04:22", "text": "おお。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3863.91, "timestamp": "01:04:23", "text": "名前を見せてほしいのか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3866.95, "timestamp": "01:04:26", "text": "つまり、つまり、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3867.99, "timestamp": "01:04:27", "text": "こいつらは絶対にありえない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3877.91, "timestamp": "01:04:37", "text": "待って、リンクをコピーさせて。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3879.91, "timestamp": "01:04:39", "text": "待って、エージェントのロックを解除するにはどうすればいいの？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3882.39, "timestamp": "01:04:42", "text": "王国通貨を稼ぐために、まだ地道な努力が必要ですよね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3883.51, "timestamp": "01:04:43", "text": "？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3884.23, "timestamp": "01:04:44", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3895.029, "timestamp": "01:04:55", "text": "待って、何をプレイすればいいの？ 私の代理人を選んでください"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3897.75, "timestamp": "01:04:57", "text": "。"}]